# Binaries the devctl Makefile and the architect go-build job write next to the
# sources, and the CI scratch files (.ldflags from go-test, .platforms from
# go-build). Untracked they flip Go's VCS stamp to vcs.modified=true and
# pkg/project's build-info fallback reports vX.Y.Z+dirty.
/klaus-gateway
/klaus-gateway-*
.ldflags
.platforms
